  this file requires the region to be CAPTURED rather than summarised, so nothing
  below ever contributes a log line, a deployment line or a count to the region,
  and no reader can mistake annotation for observation.

CAPTURE STATUS AND PROVENANCE, RE-VERIFIED RATHER THAN TRUSTED
  CAPTURE STATUS is CAPTURED.  The region was mined from a real Java 17 container
  startup, not composed.  That is not asserted here, it is re-derived: the window
  source named in the header is still on disk, so the byte range recorded above
